Course kit: license
===================

Two kinds of material, two licenses. Both are permissive; the split is about
what each kind of thing is, not about how freely you may use it.


The documents
-------------

CLAUDE.md, METHOD.md, CASEBOOK.md, BRAND.md, DESIGN-DOC-TEMPLATE.md, README.md
and the files in .claude/commands/ are licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0):

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Share and adapt them for any purpose, including commercially, with attribution.
Adapting the rules file into your own project is the intended use; that is what
the FILL holes are for.

Attribute to Pavol Chvala, and link back to the course they were extracted
from if you can: https://github.com/PavolC/neural-nets


