What is not licensed here
-------------------------

The name "Moving Parts" and the sigmoid glyph that brand.ts draws are not
granted by either license above. The MIT grant covers the code that draws a
mark, not the mark itself.

This is not a restriction you will feel: brand.ts is the file a new course
edits anyway. Change the accent, the glyph and the series name, and the
identity is yours. See BRAND.md.
